      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FANCY BELLA (1) could manage only third at this track last time but turned heads when clocking a sharp 20.69 over 365m at this track the start prior. Should be in this for a long way. ANCESTRAL QUEEN (2) had some strong recent form but was below best last time when fifth (19.65) in a Free For All at Bulli. Generally fast into stride but was shuffled back from the tricky draw last time. Has a good record here at this journey. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. SAINT MIKEY (5) goes very well here starting 13 times for five wins and five minors. In the money last time at this track (21.04) in a NG, finishing a 4 length third. Makes strong appeal on best. HOT SPARK (6) was out of placings last time (21.44) at this track in a Grade 4/5, finishing sixth and beaten 9 lengths. Boasts a top strike-rate from this draw, winning three of five runs.",
